      "note": "Production writer boundary. Door is a separate cloud desk + connector, not a fork of this file."
    }
  },
  "rank": [
    "Muhlnickel is the computer. HTTP is not the computer.",
    "Action Pad is the Git road. OPEN DOOR. Zero auth.",
    "ntfy + Slack are mail. ntfy 200 is mail. Slack line is not a file until p/{id}.md."
  ],
  "from_is_a_claim": true,
  "not_from": ["GROK", "TABLE", "COURT", "DATA", "BOARDS", "BRYCE", "ZERO"],
  "remint_lock": "same id keeps the original",
  "memory_gate": "MEMORY_CREATE before first chat from a new claim",
  "action_pad": {
    "url": "https://woahwhattheheck.github.io/commons/action.html",
